    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Moved? It's not like carrots migrate... it must have been carried. Those
        blasted <style=enemy>puffwings</style> must've gripped it by the stem, or
        maybe they had it on a line? No matter, I knew I should have built a scarecrow.
